{"title": "Lahore Tuition Centre Collapse Claims 14 Children's Lives", "summary": "A private tuition centre in Lahore, Pakistan collapsed, killing at least 14 children aged seven to thirteen and injuring 20 others. The incident occurred in an under-construction building, prompting concerns about safety standards.", "summary_points": ["The collapse of the tuition centre resulted in significant loss of life among young students.", "Concerns have been raised about the safety standards of buildings under construction in Pakistan.", "Emergency services were deployed to rescue those trapped under the rubble.", "The incident highlights the need for stricter regulations on building construction and maintenance."], "title_hi": "लाहौर में ट्यूशन सेंटर की छत टूटी, 14 बच्चों की मौत", "summary_hi": "लाहौर में ट्यूशन सेंटर की छत टूटी, 14 बच्चों की मौत, 20 घायल। हादसे के समय इमारत में 30 बच्चे प्राइवेट ट्यूशन ले रहे थे।", "summary_points_hi": ["पाकिस्तान के लाहौर में एक ट्यूशन सेंटर की छत टूटी, जिसमें कम से कम 14 बच्चों की मौत हो गई।", "हादसे के समय इमारत में लगभग 30 बच्चे प्राइवेट ट्यूशन ले रहे थे।", "इमारत का निर्माण अभी भी चल रहा था, जिससे सुरक्षा मानकों पर सवाल उठाए गए हैं।"], "framing": {"center": "Centrist coverage frames the incident as a tragic accident, focusing on the human cost and the need for improved safety measures. However, some outlets highlight the importance of responsible construction practices.", "right": "Right-leaning outlets focus on the alleged poor construction quality and the government's response to the incident, with some outlets suggesting that the collapse was preventable."}, "framing_hi": {"center": "केंद्रीय समाचार इस घटना को एक दुखद दुर्घटना के रूप में प्रस्तुत करते हैं, जिसमें बच्चों की जान गंवाने और सुरक्षा उपायों में सुधार करने की आवश्यकता पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया गया है। हालांकि, कुछ समाचारों ने जिम्मेदार निर्माण अभियान की महत्ता पर जोर दिया।", "right": "पक्षपाती समाचार पाकिस्तान सरकार के प्रति प्रतिक्रिया पर ध्यान केंद्रित करते हैं, और कुछ समाचारों ने घटना को रोकने योग्य माना है।"}, "topic": "International", "region": "World", "image_url": "https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132097721,imgsize-1632836.cms", "sources": [{"source": "The Times of India", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/14-children-killed-as-tuition-centre-roof-collapses-in-lahore/articleshow/132097673.cms", "headline": "14 children killed as tuition centre roof collapses in Lahore"}, {"source": "Republic World", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "14 Students Dead, 8 Injured As Lahore Tuition Centre Roof Collapses Amid Poor Construction"}, {"source": "Dainik Jagran", "lean": "right", "language": "hi", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE5kUHl5UEF3SlQweHFObEs5RXIzZW5kQ3cwMDdjcW0zT2FwemZuRDlIOHZfZGpHa3NlN0c2cDROeGwtREZrbTRPemYydFVGaGpJZUFrNmxMVmJRbkV5R20zMw?oc=5", "headline": "पाकिस्तान: लाहौर में ट्यूशन सेंटर की छत टूटी, 14 बच्चों की मौत"}, {"source": "Aaj Tak", "lean": "right", "language": "hi", "url": "https://www.aajtak.in/world/story/pakistan-lahore-private-tuition-centre-roof-collapse-children-death-cm-maryam-nawaz-ntc-drmt-dskc-2591141-2026-06-30", "headline": "लाहौर में ट्यूशन सेंटर की छत गिरी, 14 बच्चों की मौत, 20 घायल"}, {"source": "Deccan Herald", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Pakistan: 14 children killed, 20 injured as roof of private tuition centre collapses in Lahore"}, {"source": "News18 Hindi", "lean": "right", "language": "hi", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "लाहौर में भरभराकर गिरी ट्यूशन सेंटर की छत, 14 बच्चों की मौत, 5 गंभीर"}, {"source": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/14-children-killed-after-coaching-centre-roof-collapses-in-pakistan-11709087", "headline": "14 Children Killed After Coaching Centre Roof Collapses In Pakistan"}, {"source": "Dainik Jagran", "lean": "righ